1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Most people set up their home office completely wrong.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,900
Today I will fix yours in three steps.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,000
um

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,800
Step one is the desk height and the monitor height.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Your eyes should hit the top third of the screen.

6
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:28,400
So the desk height matters more than the chair.

7
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,200
so yeah

8
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:39,500
Step two is light, natural light from the side.

9
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:45,000
Never put the window behind the monitor, the glare kills you.

10
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,800
Never put the window behind the monitor, it will glare.

11
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:56,000
A cheap lamp with a warm bulb fixes the evening light too.

12
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:05,400
Step three is sound, which nobody thinks about.

13
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:11,200
Hard walls echo, so a rug and a bookshelf help a lot.

14
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:17,000
Your microphone sounds twice as good in a soft room.

15
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,000
basically

16
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:27,300
Let me show you my setup with all three fixes.

17
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:34,000
The desk is at seventy two centimetres, the lamp is on the left.

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:41,000
And the rug took my echo from terrible to fine.

19
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:48,500
That is the whole checklist, it is in the description.

20
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:55,600
If you change one thing this week, change the light.

21
00:01:55,800 --> 00:02:00,000
See you in the next one.

